A subset of iPhone 18 Pro Max users in the U.S. are experiencing issues with AT&T cellular connectivity and/or eSIM provisioning, according to complaints across the <a href="https://forums.macrumors.com/threads/cellular-issue-all-bars-drop-out.2490070/">MacRumors Forums</a>, <a href="https://www.reddit.com/r/ATT/comments/1wn54ip/anyone_else_getting_sos_on_iphone_18_pro_max_this/">Reddit</a>, and the <a href="https://discussions.apple.com/thread/256360691?sortBy=rank">Apple Support Community</a>.<br/>
<br/>
