Affected users are unable to connect to the AT&T network for phone calls, text messages, or data.<br/>
<br/>
Notably, the U.S. version of the iPhone 18 Pro Max is the only new iPhone released this month that is <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/09/18/iphone-18-pro-max-us-qualcomm-x80/">equipped with a Qualcomm cellular modem</a>. The smaller iPhone 18 Pro and the iPhone Duo are equipped with Apple's C2 modem worldwide, as is the iPhone 18 Pro Max in all other countries. However, it is unclear if this is a contributing factor.<br/>
